hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1636","###
 Narrated to us by Ali bin Khushram, who said: Isa informed us, on the authority of Al-A'mash, on the authority of Ibrahim, on the authority of Al-Aswad, who said: ""Alqama and I entered upon Ibn Mas'ud (RA). He asked, 'Did these people pray behind you?' We replied, 'No.' He said, 'Then stand up and pray.' So we went to stand behind him, but he took hold of our hands, placing one of us on his right and the other on his"
